                                                             core:altLabel "measurement module"^^xsd:string ;
                                                             core:definition "A measurement component is a component of a measuring system, that does measuring. [Allotrope]"^^xsd:string ;
                                                             core:editorialNote "The criteria is compromise. Some measurement components can be fully standalone measurement devices used in a component role, but are not typically used as such. A UV spectrometer is an electromagnetic absorbance measuring instrument and an elecctromagnetic absorbance detector has the same function, but it is used as part of a larger system, such as a HPLC-UV system."^^xsd:string ;
                                                             core:prefLabel "measurement component"^^xsd:string .


