###  http://purl.allotrope.org/ontologies/process#AFP_0002792
<http://purl.allotrope.org/ontologies/process#AFP_0002792> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                           rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.allotrope.org/ontologies/process#AFP_0003312> ,
