###  http://purl.allotrope.org/ontologies/process#AFP_0003706
<http://purl.allotrope.org/ontologies/process#AFP_0003706> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                           rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.allotrope.org/ontologies/process#AFP_0003315> ,
                                                                           [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
