                                                                        "first name"^^xsd:string ,
                                                                        "forename"^^xsd:string ;
                                                          core:changeNote "2019-05-10 Moved under written name [Allotrope]"^^xsd:string ;
                                                          core:definition "A given name is a name that is a part of a person's personal name. [Wikipedia]"^^xsd:string ;
                                                          core:editorialNote "The given name is provided (alongside family name) for use when describing parts of people's names. Although these concepts do not capture the full range of personal naming styles found world-wide, they are commonly used and have some value. [FoaF]"^^xsd:string ;
                                                          core:prefLabel "given name"^^xsd:string .


