                 core:definition "A physical quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's disposition to transmit of an entity through a medium. [PATO]"^^xsd:string ;
                 core:example "Examples could be heat or electricity or sound."^^xsd:string ;
                 core:prefLabel "conductivity (quality)"^^xsd:string .


